\]
Precompose the pushout relation with the coproduct injection indexed by \(x\). Simplifying the coproduct maps gives exactly
\[
f_{x.i}\,;\,\iota_x\,;\rho=x.t\,;\iota.
\]
This is the mechanism behind `FunctorObjIndex.comm` in the [small-object construction](https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/blob/master/Mathlib/CategoryTheory/SmallObject/Construction.lean).

